  "text": "Stop issuing angry refunds to disappointed customers. Taking customer money for unavailable inventory destroys your brand reputation and triggers payment processor holds. Spreadsheets and late-night manual checks cannot keep up with fluctuating warehouse inventory across multiple suppliers. Instead, build an automated inventory webhook using Make that pauses Shopify product variants whenever supplier stock hits zero. You keep your customer dispute rate near zero.",
